{"publicId":"84913451-388b-4d5c-8146-633365f8f580","title":"中科院长春光学所团队发表III-nitride异质结集成传感与存储新方案","status":"watching","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-11T13:40:09.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-11T13:40:09.000Z","digest":"中科院长春光学所等团队在《Nature Materials》发表III-nitride异质结器件集成传感与存储的新方案，实验显示其响应速度提升至毫秒级。该研究通过优化异质结界面工程与能带结构设计，首次实现光电子传感与数据存储的物理集成，突破传统方案需分立器件的局限。论文已正式发表（DOI:10.1038/s41563-026-02780-7），实验验证基于实验室规模样品（尺寸5×5mm²），未提及大规模量产或临床应用数据。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-11T14:43:15.803Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"中科院长春光学所等团队在 Nature Materials 发表 III-nitride 异质结器件集成传感与存储的新方案","latestReport":{"id":"zur9f29o4yfddim22cbecx0dq"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":0,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fv-uQCX43Ves","title":"中科院长春光学所等团队在 Nature Materials 发表 III-nitride 异质结器件集成传感与存储的新方","firstReportAt":"2026-11-11T13:40:09.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"zur9f29o4yfddim22cbecx0dq","title":"中科院长春光学所等团队在 Nature Materials 发表 III-nitride 异质结器件集成传感与存储的新方案","summary":"中科院长春光学所等团队在 Nature Materials 发表 III-nitride 异质结器件集成传感与存储的新方案（DOI:10.1038/s41563-026-02780-7）。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T13:40:09.000Z","selected":true}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"zur9f29o4yfddim22cbecx0dq","title":"中科院长春光学所等团队在 Nature Materials 发表 III-nitride 异质结器件集成传感与存储的新方案","summary":"中科院长春光学所等团队在 Nature Materials 发表 III-nitride 异质结器件集成传感与存储的新方案（DOI:10.1038/s41563-026-02780-7）。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T13:40:09.000Z","selected":true}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-11T16:00:00.000Z","heat":9.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T21:00:00.000Z","heat":8.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T22:00:00.000Z","heat":7.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T23:00:00.000Z","heat":7.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T00:00:00.000Z","heat":7.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T01:00:00.000Z","heat":7